8:53.693416+00:00","global_name":"bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-9p.1","local_name":"bob-cli-9p.1","metadata":{"agent_clan":"bob-cli-9p","agent_clan_generation":"20261019080214","bead_id":"bob-cli-9p.1","changespec_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","cl_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","clan_summary":"[bold #D75FFF]◆ EPIC bob-cli-9p[/bold #D75FFF]\n[dim]  Title: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]Continuation highlights: a `<` note folds a highlight into the one [/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]         [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]before it[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]A Highlights note that starts with `<` makes `bob ref` render that [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]highlight and its notes as one quote with the highlight before it, [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]across pages or within a paragraph. Block identity, tasks, and [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]published anchors stay stable. A marker that cannot merge stays [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]visible and is counted.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]2[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202610/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]highlight_continuations.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202610/highlight_continuations.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-9p[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-9p/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Parse, plan, and render continuation groups[/bold #D7AFFF]                   [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]render-fold[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]render-fold: add `page_index` to sidecar annotations, a pure [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`continuation.rs` planner (marker grammar, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]nearest-earlier-text-highlight walk, page-aware seams, range labels), [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and a group render path. Every text highlight renders through the group [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]path, so unmerged notes stay byte-identical. Also add head-ID identity, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]redirect stubs for published follower anchors, and per-piece task [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]identity with group 🔖 links, plus a Gas Town golden test and a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]live-vault dry-run regression check.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Continuation counters, scan output, and docs[/bold #D7AFFF]                  [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]scan-visibility-docs[dim] · [dim][/dim]after render-fold[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]scan-visibility-docs: surface merged and dangling continuations in the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]verbose plan, write report, per-PDF scan line, and scan JSON. Document [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the gesture, seam rule, identity rules, and stubs in [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]docs/highlights-ref-sync.md and the README. Record the decisions strand [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]if accepted.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Plural page labels in Bob Mac Capture[/bold #D7AFFF]                         [bold black on #5FD7AF] xsmall [/bold black on #5FD7AF]\n    [#AF87FF]mac-pp-label[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]mac-pp-label: in the linked bob-mac-capture repo, make [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`RefsCopyFormat.shortPageLabel` render `Pages 11–12` as `pp. 11–12`, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]matching `Page 11` → `p. 11`, with tests.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-9p","llm_provider":"grok","model":"grok-4.6","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-9p.1","reasoning_effort":"high","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-416496b4fe564b104b0306c5b610928d","started_at":"2026-10-19T12:03:35.277681+00:00","state":"completed